Build Notes for Wallpaper Switcher on Kubuntu
=============================================

These are the packages that need to be installed on Kubuntu in order
to build and install the wallpaper switcher.  Install them with
apt-get or your favourite package manager.

   build-essential
   cmake
   extra-cmake-modules
   kio-dev
   libkf6configwidgets-dev
   libkf6crash-dev
   libkf6iconthemes-dev
   libkf6notifications-dev
   libkf6widgetsaddons-dev
   libkf6xmlgui-dev
   plasma-workspace-dev
   qtbase6-dev
   qtdeclarative6-dev
   gettext

Thanks are due to user https://github.com/jamadagni for providing this
list in issue #9.  The list originally applied to KDE Frameworks 5, and
assumes that the same packages are required for Frameworks 6.
